<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Automatically serves the money printinter GrandRP 1920  x 1080 FHD</Major>
    <Description>With this macro you can theoretically be AFK for 24 hours and at the same time automatically empty and restart the money printer without going into sleep mode.

You can set in line 5 how much time is left until the money printing machine is operated for the first time. The default setting here is the full 4 hours. 1 repetition stands for 5 minutes.

The Macro only works with FHD 1920 x 1080 resolution.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 1000 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 299 s
GoWhile 1 48
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 1000 ms
MoveTo 774 438
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 1000 ms
MoveTo 1003 506
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 1000 ms
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 2000 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 1000 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 299 s
GoWhile 26 48
Goto 6</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>